Tens of thousands protested in Copenhagen, demanding climate 'action'
Tens of thousands of protesters marched across the streets this Saturday, demanding more emphatic climate action from negotiators at the city's Bella convention center.
Protesters cited the number of many hundreds of thousands of participants in the event, but police exaggerate that the number was closer to 25000.
