Gracielina's parents hardly graduated from college in El Salvador.
So far Graciela herself, who was born in Silver Spring and lived in Riverdale, has never entered the attic.
Now she and other eighth-grade pupils in the group were exploring Gettysburg, where the tuition fee amounted to 38690 dollars a year, their position was rather rather than fearful visitors enthusiastic potential students.
