Burda
At 27 they are supposed to take over the publishing house children
Kallen's new head of the publishing house is a transitional solution: In the long term, Hubert Burda wants to hand over his business to his two children, SPIEGELU said.
In the future, the holding will also belong to a family of 100 percent.
Hubert Burda, the publisher, has long seen his business in the hands of his children.
Both children will be inherited at the age of 27 and have a strong will to enter the business, the 69-year-old SPIEGEL man says.
We dealt with the details carefully.
The question of whether they are also active in the company is asked later.
Even the question of whether they have the skills to do it.
It is not possible to put 7500 employees at the forefront of their children if they are not capable enough.
It would kill both the children and the business.
Burda announced on Thursday that he had been withdrawing from the chairmanship of the board since January, appointing Paul-Bernhard Kallen as his successor.
The 52-year-old Kallen has been a member of Burda's board of directors since 1999.
At first he was in charge of technology.
Later, responsibility for the company’s assets was added with the Treasury section, and after Jürgen Todenhöfer’s resignation, direct marketing, Foreign Affairs, Print and Finance.
For the first time, none of the family members are at the head of the publishing house.
Burda's children are 19 and 17 years old, his son Felix, who would have been 42, died a few years ago.
Kallen's appointment also serves to "bridle for 10, 15 years," Burda said.
Holding is expected to belong to 100 percent family in the future, Burda says.
In view of Schickedanz and Schaeffler cases, Burda commented that even family businesses were unsure of extinction: "This has always been touched by companies that have been infected by the desire for capital they have speculated and thought they could become big players.
That was never my strategy.
He's never had "dreams of world power," Burda argues.
I don't see myself as a political preceptor of this country like Springer, and I don't want to play the world league with "Time," these deals are too big.
Comprehensive beauty care
