The offer is conditional on the appointment of eight out of 15 board members.
Jerez Group provides a 15-day deadline for shareholders to announce their interest to sell shares.
CNMV said it had not been notified of the offer, even as Ruize Mateos's business confirmed it had teamed up with the regulatory authority.
If the purchase is made, the price would reach 611.7 million, while the capitalization of Sos is 254.27 million.
