As an attempt to remain on the sidelines of possible bids to buy and offset judicial fluctuations of his former leaders, Jesús and Jaime Salazar brothers, the election of María Luisa Jordá as head of an internal audit was announced.
This decision makes her the first woman to occupy a senior position in a food business.
