CNMV authorizes option to expel Paternina, attended by Inversora Mer
The National Securities Market Commission (CNMV) yesterday authorized the exclusion, involving Inversora Mer, against Federica Paternino on October 9.
The Supervisory Authority explained that it authorises this operation because it understands that its conditions comply with the applicable standards and considers that there is "sufficient" the content explaining the brochure submitted after the modifications introduced on 2 December.
